		(property "Description" "Dual bus buffer gate: J_SAI2 data in (AUX_I2S_DIN) to Teensy SAI2_IN through 33 R. Gate 1 OE = SAI2_nOE_HDR (header master mode), gate 2 OE = SAI2_nOE_OUT (Teensy master mode); both inputs tied, outputs joined after the resistors, so the header data reaches the Teensy in either header mode and is tri-stated in internal mode."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
