		(property "Description" "Quad 2:1 mux with 3-state outputs, 3.3 V LVC. Selects the internal SAI2 source: S=SAI2_SEL low = IDC777 (BT_BCK/BT_LRCK/BT_SDATA), high = ESP32-S3 (S3_I2S_BCK/LRCK/DOUT). Outputs through 33 R to SAI2_BCLK/SAI2_LRCLK/SAI2_IN. OE = SAI2_nOE_INT from the U23 interlock (mode 00 only). Channel 4 unused (inputs grounded)."
